+/**
+ * Application context for platform storages that the fork's feature ports add. MainActivity already
+ * initializes the downloads platform with the application context at startup, so those storages can
+ * read it from here instead of needing their own MainActivity initialize() call (which would break
+ * every time upstream reshuffles MainActivity).
